DCTelnet v1.9.1 (29 Aug 2026)
A classic Amiga Telnet/BBS client with Zmodem
* NEW v1.9.1: New toolbar icons in fullscreen
* 68000 compatible
* Fullscreen, windowed, and iconified modes
* Fast: uses the TCP/IP stack directly
* No telser/MUI/ClassAct/ReAction needed
